      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A beautifully presented three-bedroom house situated in a quiet private cul-de-sac within the highly regarded Dun Brinn development, this exceptional property is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers a superb opportunity for first-time buyers, families or those seeking a stylish, low-maintenance home.\nNo expense has been spared in creating a home that is both elegant and practical, with every room individually designed and expertly decorated. The attention to detail is immediately apparent, with attractive coving and centre roses adding character throughout, while the ground floor features stunning LVT flooring laid in a sophisticated herringbone design.\nThe accommodation briefly comprises entrance hall, spacious living room, open-plan kitchen/dining room, utility room and guest WC at ground floor level. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, including a main bedroom with en suite, together with the family bathroom.\nThe living room is a warm and inviting space, beautifully finished and ideal for relaxing or entertaining. The impressive kitchen/dining room features modern fitted units and a large island-style breakfast table, creating a superb contemporary hub for everyday family life and entertaining.\nThe utility room is particularly practical, with plumbing for both washing machine and dryer, a side door providing convenient access to the rear garden, and housing the modern combi boiler. The combi boiler provides instant hot water directly from the tap, adding significantly to the convenience and efficiency of the home.\nAll windows are double glazed, while the front entrance is fitted with a high-quality triple-glazed composite door.\nOutside, the property continues to impress. To the front is a paved driveway providing private off-street parking, while the house is positioned in a peaceful private cul-de-sac overlooking a large landscaped green area with beautiful mature trees, creating an attractive and tranquil setting.\nThe rear garden has been designed with low maintenance in mind and features artificial grass and a superb covered pergola adjoining the patio doors. The pergola provides an excellent sheltered outdoor entertaining space and is a particularly attractive feature of the property. There is also a steel garden shed with electricity, external power sockets to both the front and rear, and an external water tap.\n\nLocation Dun Brinn, Athy\nDun Brinn is a popular and well-established residential development located on the edge of Athy town, offering residents a peaceful suburban environment while remaining within easy reach of the town centre and a wide range of amenities.\nOne of the major advantages of the location is its excellent road connectivity. The Athy Distributor Road provides easy access around the town and greatly improves connectivity to the M9 motorway, Carlow, Kilkenny and Dublin via the surrounding road network. This makes Dun Brinn particularly attractive to commuters while also providing convenient access to the wider region.\nAthy itself offers an excellent range of amenities including supermarkets, shops, restaurants, cafés, pubs, schools, childcare facilities, sporting clubs, medical services and recreational amenities. Athy railway station provides regular rail services, while the town`s location on the River Barrow offers attractive walking and cycling opportunities.\nThe nearby Grand Canal and Barrow Blueway provide excellent opportunities for walking, cycling and enjoying the outdoors, while the People`s Park and a number of sporting and recreational facilities are also close by. Kildare Village, the Curragh and the National Stud are within easy driving distance, adding to the appeal of the location.\nThis is a turnkey property which has been exceptionally well cared for and tastefully upgraded, offering prospective purchasers the opportunity to simply move in and enjoy.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Hall Living Room Kitchen/Dining Room Utility Room Guest WC\nFirst Floor Bedroom 1 Main Bedroom with En suite Bedroom 2 Bedroom 3 Family Bathroom\n\nBER Rating: C\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, presentation and attention to detail this exceptional home has to offer.\nViewings by appointment.\nContact Connaughton Auctioneers on 059 863 2815."
      },
